WEBVTT

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.709
IT SEEMS SILLY, DOESN'T IT,
A WEDDING?

00:00:11.752 --> 00:00:15.452
GIVEN EVERYTHING
THAT'S GOING ON.

00:00:15.495 --> 00:00:17.976
M-MAYBE THAT'S THE BEST REASON
TO HAVE IT --

00:00:18.019 --> 00:00:20.674
BECAUSEOF EVERYTHING
THAT'S GOING ON.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:36.908
Arthur:
MARVELOUS!

00:00:36.951 --> 00:00:39.606
George: MORNING.

00:00:43.436 --> 00:00:45.873
AAH!

00:00:49.399 --> 00:00:52.184
COME ON! KEEP UP!

00:00:52.227 --> 00:00:54.229
ALL TOGETHER NOW!

00:00:54.273 --> 00:00:55.927
ONE...

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:57.668
TWO...

00:00:57.711 --> 00:00:59.365
THREE!

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:11.029
HOW'S IT LOOKING
YOUR END, BOYS?

00:01:11.072 --> 00:01:12.683
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:01:12.726 --> 00:01:15.599
Fred: BRILLIANT!George: BRILLIANT!

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:18.210
BLOODY HELL.

00:01:18.253 --> 00:01:20.952
WHAT'S THE MINISTER OF MAGIC
DOING HERE?

00:01:27.132 --> 00:01:29.569
TO WHAT DO WE OWE THE PLEASURE,
MINISTER?

00:01:29.613 --> 00:01:33.355
I THINK WE BOTH KNOW THE ANSWER
TO THAT QUESTION, MR. POTTER.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:43.670
AND THIS IS...?

00:01:51.504 --> 00:01:55.726
"HEREIN IS SET FORTH
THE LAST WILL AND TESTAMENT

00:01:55.769 --> 00:02:00.470
"OF ALBUS PERCIVAL WULFRIC
BRIAN DUMBLEDORE.

00:02:00.513 --> 00:02:05.170
"FIRST,
TO RONALD BILIUS WEASLEY,

00:02:05.213 --> 00:02:08.129
"I LEAVE MY DELUMINATOR,

00:02:08.173 --> 00:02:11.002
"A DEVICE OF MY OWN MAKING

00:02:11.045 --> 00:02:16.398
"IN THE HOPE THAT,
WHEN THINGS SEEM MOST DARK,

00:02:16.442 --> 00:02:20.272
IT WILL SHOW HIM THE LIGHT."

00:02:26.408 --> 00:02:28.280
DUMBLEDORE LEFT THIS
FOR ME?

00:02:28.323 --> 00:02:30.543
Scrimgeour: YEAH.

00:02:30.587 --> 00:02:33.024
BRILLIANT.

00:02:33.067 --> 00:02:34.547
WHAT IS IT?

00:02:34.591 --> 00:02:35.853
[ STAMMERS ]

00:02:45.645 --> 00:02:47.299
[ CHUCKLES SOFTLY ]

00:02:47.342 --> 00:02:48.996
WICKED.

00:02:51.259 --> 00:02:54.480
Scrimgeour:
"TO HERMIONE JEAN GRANGER,

00:02:54.524 --> 00:02:59.790
"I LEAVE MY COPY OF
'THE TALES OF BEEDLE THE BARD'

00:02:59.833 --> 00:03:04.534
IN THE HOPE THAT SHE FIND IT
ENTERTAINING AND INSTRUCTIVE."

00:03:04.577 --> 00:03:06.623
Ron: MUM USED TO
READ ME THOSE.

00:03:06.666 --> 00:03:08.973
"THE WIZARD
AND THE HOPPING POT."

00:03:09.016 --> 00:03:11.279
"BABBITTY RABBITTY
AND THE CACKLING STUMP."

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:13.412
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:03:13.455 --> 00:03:17.416
OH, COME ON.
"BABBITTY RABBITTY"?

00:03:17.459 --> 00:03:19.157
NO?

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:22.682
"TO HARRY JAMES POTTER,

00:03:22.726 --> 00:03:25.032
"I LEAVE THE SNITCH HE CAUGHT

00:03:25.076 --> 00:03:26.904
"IN HIS FIRST QUIDDITCH MATCH
AT HOGWARTS

00:03:26.947 --> 00:03:33.650
"AS A REMINDER OF THE REWARDS
OF PERSEVERANCE...

00:03:33.693 --> 00:03:36.391
AND SKILL."

00:03:55.367 --> 00:03:57.543
IS THAT IT, THEN?

00:03:57.587 --> 00:03:59.806
NOT QUITE.

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:05.290
DUMBLEDORE LEFT YOU
A SECOND BEQUEST --

00:04:05.333 --> 00:04:08.467
THE SWORD
OF GODRIC GRYFFINDOR.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:11.252
UNFORTUNATELY,
THE SWORD OF GRYFFINDOR

00:04:11.296 --> 00:04:13.907
WAS NOT DUMBLEDORE'S
TO GIVE AWAY.

00:04:13.951 --> 00:04:17.563
AS AN IMPORTANT HISTORICAL
ARTIFACT, IT BELONGS --

00:04:17.607 --> 00:04:19.043
Hermione: TO HARRY.

00:04:19.086 --> 00:04:20.566
IT BELONGS
TO HARRY.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.873
IT CAME TO HIM
WHEN HE MOST NEEDED IT

00:04:22.916 --> 00:04:24.657
IN THE CHAMBER
OF SECRETS.

00:04:24.701 --> 00:04:26.050
THE SWORD MAY PRESENT ITSELF

00:04:26.093 --> 00:04:28.008
TO ANY WORTHY GRYFFINDOR,
MISS GRANGER.

00:04:28.052 --> 00:04:30.271
THAT DOES NOT MAKE IT
THAT WIZARD'S PROPERTY.

00:04:30.315 --> 00:04:33.187
AND, IN ANY EVENT,
THE CURRENT WHEREABOUTS

00:04:33.231 --> 00:04:35.450
OF THE SWORD ARE UNKNOWN.

00:04:35.494 --> 00:04:38.105
EXCUSE ME?THE SWORD IS MISSING.

00:04:38.149 --> 00:04:43.067
I DON'T KNOW
WHAT YOU'RE UP TO, MR. POTTER,

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:47.158
BUT YOU CAN'T FIGHT THIS WAR
ON YOUR OWN.

00:04:47.201 --> 00:04:49.639
HE'S TOO STRONG.

00:04:54.426 --> 00:04:58.604
[ UP-TEMPO MUSIC PLAYING ]

00:04:58.648 --> 00:05:01.128
[ RHYTHMIC CLAPPING ]

00:05:18.842 --> 00:05:22.193
[ LAUGHTER AND CHEERS ]

